OL,3,AAt least 17 killed after vehicle loaded
OL,4,Awith explosives rams Pakistan mosque
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 17 people have been killed and
OL,7,F73 others wounded after a vehicle laden
OL,8,Fwith explosives rammed into a mosque in
OL,9,Fnorth-western Pakistan, according to
OL,10,FPakistan's news agency.
OL,12,FSeven police officers and a
OL,13,Ffour-year-old child are among those
OL,14,Fkilled in the attack, which also
OL,15,Finvolved gunmen opening fire within a
OL,16,Fpolice facility in the city of Kohat in
OL,17,Fthe province of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, the
OL,18,FAssociated Press of Pakistan (APP)
OL,19,Freported.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
