OL,3,AAt least 17 killed after vehicle loaded
OL,4,Awith explosives rams Pakistan mosque
OL,5,
OL,6,FVideo found by BBC Verify shows the
OL,7,Fsite covered in rubble and people
OL,8,Ftending to casualties.
OL,10,FPakistan's President Asif Ali Zardari
OL,11,Fexpressed "his best wishes for the
OL,12,Fswift recovery of those injured in the
OL,13,Fexplosion" in a statement.
